    "kk_fws_tap_warning": {
      "type": "kk-fws-tap-warning",
      "blocks": {
        "paragraph_intro": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every year, millions of Americans fall sick by ingesting harmful chemicals through tap water. In Baltimore, they recently detected a <strong>parasite</strong> in the drinking water… in California’s Coachella Valley, they found water from fast-food soda fountains contained <strong>salmonella</strong>… and in Iowa, they identified unsafe amounts of <strong>nitrate and alachlor</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_effects": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>These chemicals have been linked to a range of dangerous side effects - <strong>liver and kidney damage, thyroid disease, cancer</strong> and even <strong>“blue baby syndrome”</strong> in infants. Phoenix Gravity Water Filters use a powerful <strong>Nano Toxin filter technology</strong> to remove <strong>99.9% of contaminants</strong> from tap water, making it safe to drink in any city in America!</p>"
          }
        },
